      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are also some additional problems I've noticed with my GPU and VRChat frame time. There seems to be this \"movement lag interval\" that keeps appearing in different worlds. If I go into the Video Settings for VRChat in Steam VR and set a different locked fps, it makes it go away. But I find I'm doing this for all types of different worlds. It's getting a little ridiculous.\n\nThere are other worlds too which I still experience the aggressive shaking with different environments. There is no setting I can enable which seems to fix this.\n\nPlease help!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
